          "text": "Progress of One Nation One Ration Card implementation in States/UTs \n \n \nProgress of NFSA Population Coverage under ONORC \n \n \n❖ 80 Crore beneficiaries avail benefit of ONORC, recording nearly three crore portability \ntransactions per month.8 \n \n❖ The Department of Food and Public Distribution (DFPD) received the Prime Minister’s \nAward for Excellence in Public Administration, 2020 for the ‘One Nation One Ration \nCard’ scheme.9 \n \n❖ The Department is collaborating with other Ministries/Departments to leverage the \nONORC database for deepening the outreach of citizen-centric government schemes \nacross the country. 10 \n \n8 https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleseDetail.aspx?PRID=1847386 \n9 https://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=1819025 \n10 https://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=1819025",
