          "page": 5,
          "layout": "text",
          "text": "❖ A specially customized Android \nMobile App on ONORC “Mera \nRation” has also been launched for \nthe \nbenefit \nof \nall \nNFSA \nbeneficiaries. \nThe \napplication \nprovides multiple functionalities \nand makes portability of ration \neasier, specifically for migrant \nNFSA \nbeneficiaries. \nThe \napplication is now available in 13 \nlanguages. \n❖ To make the beneficiary aware of the benefits of the ONORC, a vigorous awareness \ngeneration campaigning – in Hindi & Regional Languages has been carried out. \n❖ A 5-digit ‘14445’ toll-free number is also available in most States/UTs under \nONORC.11 \n \nReferences: \nFactsheet Details: (pib.gov.in) \nhttps://transformingindia.mygov.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/ONORC-eng.pdf \nhttps://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=1847386#:~:text=The%20Dep \nartment%20of%20Food%20and,pilot%20project%20in%20four%20states. \nhttps://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleseDetail.aspx?PRID=1847386 \nhttps://pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=1819025 \nPress Information Bureau (pib.gov.in) \nhttps://www.nic.in/wp-content/themes/NICTheme/Brochures/One%20Nation%20One%20Ration%20Card.pdf \n \nOther Important Links: \nhttps://pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=1839388 \nhttps://www.nic.in/infographs_post/one-nation-one-ration-card/ \nhttps://newsonair.gov.in/News?title=One-Nation-One-Ration-Card-scheme-starts-in-Andaman-and-NicobarIslands&id=405280 \nhttps://www.mygov.in/task/logo-design-contest-one-nation-one-ration-card-plan/ \nhttps://newsonair.gov.in/News?title=One-Nation%2c-One-Ration-Card-scheme-becomes-operational-in-entirecountry-with-its-implementation-in-Assam&id=443062 \nhttps://newsonair.gov.in/News?title=Odisha-government-implements-One-Nation-One-Ration-card-schemeacross-State&id=423045 \n \n11 Press Information Bureau (pib.gov.in)",
